  "scope": "One disposable Kubernetes v1.36.1 cluster. A real OCI registry stores an inert model by manifest and blob digest. Separate publisher and organization OpenSSL Jobs generate ephemeral keys and sign the identical model bytes. An independent verifier checks those signatures before a digest-bound immutable promotion record is written. Native admission uses that record to gate a model consumer Pod. The allowed Pod fetches and checks exact registry bytes. Production key custody, registry identity, signer authority, worktree and namespace coverage, and policy enrollment are open.",
